/*
  JwtDecoder.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0018 · JwtDecoder (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `JwtDecoderView` resolves (table "JwtDecoder", via the `JwtDecoderStrings`
